Z||000000||Black88GT||02-06-2001||07:19 PM||||Does anyone know which Holley AFPR will fit the Fiero's fuel rail?  I heard that there was one in Summit/Jegs that will fit, for like a Camaro or something, but its the kind that has the dial on top of it so you can adjust it without removing the plenum.  If anyone knows please help...<P>TIA<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||1
